; Python Journal.query derives the option globals from the running
; report and the query's own options alone: a query's --ignore-diacritics
; no longer folds the pattern the next query's --account-rewrite compiles,
; and a query's --account-rewrite rule no longer applies to later queries.
; A query's --now does not move the clock of later queries: the first of the
; last two ends before the posting (--current finds nothing), the second runs
; at the session clock (2030/06/15, given on the test line because --current
; reads the clock), after it.

2024/01/01 Foo
    Expenses:Café                            $10.555
    Assets:Cash

test --now 2030/06/15 python test/regress/report-option-state-query.py
--ignore-diacritics cafe
  Expenses:Café $10.555
--account-rewrite Café=Wallet Expenses
  Wallet $10.555
Expenses
  Expenses:Café $10.555
--account-rewrite Cafe=Wallet Expenses
  Expenses:Café $10.555
--now 2020/01/20 --current Expenses
--current Expenses
  Expenses:Café $10.555
end test
